  "result": "Perfect! All 508 tests pass (487 + 21 new render tests).\n\n## Summary\n\n**renderInvoiceText Enhancement:**\n\n**src/render.js** - Enhanced function now displays:\n\n1. **Line-level discounts** (when applicable):\n   - Shows for lines with tier or explicit discounts\n   - Indented under the line item\n   - Format: `  Discount: \u20acX.XX`\n   - Example:\n     ```\n     2 \u00d7 Icon set @ \u20ac9.80 = \u20ac19.60\n       Discount: \u20ac0.98\n     ```\n\n2. **Vouchers** (when applied):\n   - Appears before the total\n   - Format: `Voucher (CODE): \u20acX.XX`\n   - Example: `Voucher (SAVE10): \u20ac5.00`\n\n3. **Due date** (for issued invoices):\n   - Appears after the total\n   - Format: `Due: YYYY-MM-DD`\n   - Shows the calculated due date based on payment terms\n   - Example: `Due: 2025-02-14`\n\n4. **Payment received** (when payments recorded):\n   - Appears at the end\n   - Format: `Paid: \u20acX.XX`\n   - Shows total paid so far\n   - Example: `Paid: \u20ac6.00`\n\n**Example output:**\n```\nINV-2025-0001\nNorthwind Studio\n\n1 \u00d7 Icon set @ \u20ac9.80 = \u20ac9.80\n  Discount: \u20ac0.49\n\nVoucher (PROMO): \u20ac1.00\nVAT: \u20ac1.70\nTotal: \u20ac10.01\nDue: 2025-02-14\nPaid: \u20ac6.00\n```\n\n**test/render.test.js** - Added 21 comprehensive tests covering:\n- Line discount display and indentation\n- Multiple discounts across lines\n- Bulk discount calculation\n- Voucher placement and formatting\n- Due date display for different terms (NET14, NET30, EOM)\n- Payment display for partial and full payments\n- Multiple payments accumulation\n- Complex scenarios with all features combined\n- Proper ordering of output elements",
